            "review_title": "Review at Mappi Do Frog Porridge",
            "review_text": "sha001\nSalt Lake City, Utah19 contributions\n0\nSomething different and delicious in Danang, Vietnam\nFeb 2023 • Solo\nIf you have had enough pho or noodles, go over to Mappi Dos for delicious porridge and BBQ frog or BBQ liver. And while you are there, have a delicious fruit tea with fresh fruit from the mountains of Vietnam. The food and drinks are idelicious and the vibe is cool and homey.\nWritten February 13, 2023",
