            "review_title": "Review at Mappi Do Frog Porridge",
            "review_text": "Ling L\nSingapore, Singapore11 contributions\n0\nBest frog porridge I’ve tasted!!\nMar 2018 • Solo\nI arrived at mappido’s shortly after sunset and it’s right on a little street outside where the Main Street is. This little stall\nIs ran by an inspiring 30 year old lady who cooks up a storm! The porridge is infused with pandan and goes perfectly well with the sauce and the frog legs are nicely marinated with herbs the local way. I had 2 bowls! Definitely worth visiting for an authentic Danang street year experience!! Will definitely come back again :)\nRead more\nWritten March 27, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
