            "review_title": "Review at Mappi Do Frog Porridge",
            "review_text": "Amber M\nDa Nang, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nHands down the best restaurant in Da Nang!!!\nJul 2015\nI cannot say enough good things about this restaurant or its owner. Not only does she sell the best (and cheapest) frog legs in town but she is also one of the kindest, most generous human beings I have ever had the good fortune of meeting. Mappi Do speaks excellent English and is more than happy to not only fill your belly but your soul with her positive spirit. And to make things even sweeter, you can get a delicious milktea or bubble tea from her sister's restaurant, Lucky Milktea & Foods, which is set up right alongside hers. This is definitely a place to stop while in Da Nang! Where else can you get great conversation, advice and tips on navigating the city, great food, and lifelong friends?\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 10, 2015",
