            "review_title": "Review at Mappi Do Frog Porridge",
            "review_text": "Bcleary45\n1 contribution\n0\nThe sweetest woman in Da Nang!\nApr 2014\nUnlike many of the street food vendors in da nang, this street vendor spoke English. Thao, the owner of the frog shop, is extremely friendly and very knowledgeably about the city if da nang. The food was excellent and the price was very low. The restaurant, even though it is on the street, is very nice and friendly! My friends and I were so pleased with our meal that we returned again during our trip! This is a \"must eat\" street food vendor in da nang!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 11, 2014",
