            "review_text": "Miracle5788\nHanoi, Ha Noi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nA really unique food in Da Nang\nApr 2013 • Friends\nCuisine in Da Nang is really rich. Especially there are so many street food. And Frog Porridge at Mappi Do is really the new kind which just had been served at restaurants in Da Nang before, now it appears in street food list. Let go and feel, it's so excited because the owner can speak English fluently, and she can show you some interesting places that if you go to, u'll be amazing ^^\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 23, 2013",
